Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.38,0:00:18.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.42,0:00:20.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alice's Light Cube has been ejected!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.52,0:00:22.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grab Kirigaya and log out!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.82,0:00:23.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.82,0:00:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry Rank but I\NI decided I'm going to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.06,0:00:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stay but you you don't\Nhave to you'll like Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.40,0:00:41.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's really sweet. Please take care\Nof her. She has the biggest heart and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.76,0:00:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,everyone who knows her Loves her so\Nmany sacrifice themselves for her so
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.70,0:00:53.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't let them turn her into\Na weapon for their sake and Kirito's.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.44,0:00:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,also please tell our friends I said
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.68,0:01:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thank you and I'm sorry and goodbye.
