Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.30,0:02:46.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm always,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.24,0:02:55.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Higa, I have Alice's Lightcube with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.60,0:02:56.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.51,0:03:00.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, um, Asuna decided to\Nstay in there with Kirigaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.82,0:03:05.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She did, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.73,0:03:07.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, we'll hurry it up then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.52,0:03:11.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get ready to pop the locks on\Nthe bulkhead when I call back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.44,0:03:16.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.35,0:03:17.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kojuro
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.27,0:03:19.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agents are standing by the bulkhead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.22,0:03:20.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's clear so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.52,0:03:21.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just give the word!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.02,0:03:23.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.02,0:03:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One minute since the\Nacceleration phase started.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.68,0:03:30.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ten years have already passed in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.80,0:03:32.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Higa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.92,0:03:34.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kikuoka, hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.78,0:03:51.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet you're thinking this is out\Nof character for me, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.02,0:03:52.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.93,0:03:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, sort of.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.00,0:03:57.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I figured as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.50,0:04:00.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a good reason for\Ndoing this, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.36,0:04:03.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.04,0:04:05.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.95,0:04:08.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always consider the worst-case scenario.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.08,0:04:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For now, I want to let the hijackers think\Nthey still have a chance to get Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.02,0:04:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's hope they don't notice us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.22,0:04:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rank, we're at the hatch now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.42,0:04:26.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and disable the lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.28,0:04:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.58,0:04:37.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They opened the goddamn bulkhead again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.58,0:04:39.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But they got Alice already.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.08,0:04:43.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They should be kicking back and\Nwaiting for the JSDF to roll in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.10,0:04:46.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.12,0:04:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm... That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.64,0:04:55.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rig, you're with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.18,0:04:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone else, lock and load\Nand head for the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.68,0:05:00.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Waste anything that comes\Ndown and secure that bulkhead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.52,0:05:03.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He makes it sound like a cakewalk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.10,0:05:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got something for me to do or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.44,0:05:09.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're coming along with me\Nto check out this cable duct.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.22,0:05:14.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a feeling our friends at Wrath\Nare looking for something in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.74,0:05:18.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, let's go say hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.44,0:05:43.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dad, looks like he fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.42,0:05:45.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the mole Captain Miller hired.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.48,0:05:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess they found out and\Nchucked him down the shaft.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.14,0:05:51.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.30,0:05:58.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.62,0:06:00.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay? Keeks!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.66,0:06:04.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, that stings.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.68,0:06:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.48,0:06:09.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just took a round of the vest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.50,0:06:11.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about you? You're okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.82,0:06:14.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.08,0:06:16.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me and the old laptop gotta scare us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.48,0:06:18.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.39,0:06:19.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep on working, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.96,0:06:27.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're not screwing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.26,0:06:32.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess it's time to scuttle\Nthis rig and get the hell off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.80,0:06:34.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not my call, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.56,0:06:38.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better get the captain and let him know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.62,0:06:57.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.50,0:07:09.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.41,0:07:10.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.70,0:07:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.88,0:07:13.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.24,0:07:23.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You finally crossed\Nover, Gabe. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.06,0:07:26.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alicia?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.97,0:07:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you been waiting\Nhere all this time, alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.28,0:07:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're so cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.82,0:07:39.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let go of my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.30,0:07:42.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't, Gabe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.28,0:07:44.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and I will be together from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.60,0:07:46.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.06,0:07:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.34,0:07:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.68,0:08:00.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.02,0:08:07.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.82,0:08:08.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.44,0:08:10.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.64,0:08:27.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uhhh...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.32,0:08:37.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yo, Cap!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.36,0:08:39.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wrath is alice and they...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.96,0:08:48.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.96,0:09:06.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get your ass up, the captain's—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.66,0:09:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those bastards killed brig yeah\Ncaptain to saga or dead, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.78,0:09:29.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.69,0:09:31.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no reason to\Nrisk our lives anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.86,0:09:33.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They got Ellis' light cube.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.94,0:09:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, we still have our orders, don't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.06,0:09:39.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we can't get it, we destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.98,0:09:42.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know how to set that up, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.56,0:09:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I got an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.36,0:09:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But without the cap, it's a call\Nthat's way over my pay grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.10,0:09:51.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.36,0:09:55.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.22,0:10:00.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.13,0:10:01.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the engine.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:02.41,0:10:05.62,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs62\alpha&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\fnQuadraat-Bold\blur0.5\pos(986.18,878.914)\alpha&HFF&\t(0,120,\alpha&H20&)\t(2810,2930,\alpha&HFF&)}O{\alpha&HFF&\t(11,131,\alpha&H20&)\t(2821,2941,\alpha&HFF&)}c{\alpha&HFF&\t(22,142,\alpha&H20&)\t(2832,2952,\alpha&HFF&)}e{\alpha&HFF&\t(33,153,\alpha&H20&)\t(2843,2963,\alpha&HFF&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(44,164,\alpha&H20&)\t(2854,2974,\alpha&HFF&)}n {\alpha&HFF&\t(56,176,\alpha&H20&)\t(2866,2986,\alpha&HFF&)}T{\alpha&HFF&\t(67,187,\alpha&H20&)\t(2877,2997,\alpha&HFF&)}u{\alpha&HFF&\t(78,198,\alpha&H20&)\t(2888,3008,\alpha&HFF&)}r{\alpha&HFF&\t(89,209,\alpha&H20&)\t(2899,3019,\alpha&HFF&)}t{\alpha&HFF&\t(100,220,\alpha&H20&)\t(2910,3030,\alpha&HFF&)}l{\alpha&HFF&\t(112,232,\alpha&H20&)\t(2922,3042,\alpha&HFF&)}e{\alpha&HFF&\t(123,243,\alpha&H20&)\t(2933,3053,\alpha&HFF&)}, {\alpha&HFF&\t(134,254,\alpha&H20&)\t(2944,3064,\alpha&HFF&)}S{\alpha&HFF&\t(145,265,\alpha&H20&)\t(2955,3075,\alpha&HFF&)}u{\alpha&HFF&\t(156,276,\alpha&H20&)\t(2966,3086,\alpha&HFF&)}b {\alpha&HFF&\t(168,288,\alpha&H20&)\t(2978,3098,\alpha&HFF&)}C{\alpha&HFF&\t(179,299,\alpha&H20&)\t(2989,3109,\alpha&HFF&)}o{\alpha&HFF&\t(190,310,\alpha&H20&)\t(3000,3120,\alpha&HFF&)}n{\alpha&HFF&\t(201,321,\alpha&H20&)\t(3011,3131,\alpha&HFF&)}t{\alpha&HFF&\t(212,332,\alpha&H20&)\t(3022,3142,\alpha&HFF&)}r{\alpha&HFF&\t(224,344,\alpha&H20&)\t(3034,3154,\alpha&HFF&)}o{\alpha&HFF&\t(235,355,\alpha&H20&)\t(3045,3165,\alpha&HFF&)}l {\alpha&HFF&\t(246,366,\alpha&H20&)\t(3056,3176,\alpha&HFF&)}R{\alpha&HFF&\t(257,377,\alpha&H20&)\t(3067,3187,\alpha&HFF&)}o{\alpha&HFF&\t(268,388,\alpha&H20&)\t(3078,3198,\alpha&HFF&)}o{\alpha&HFF&\t(280,400,\alpha&H20&)\t(3090,3210,\alpha&HFF&)}m
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.82,0:10:09.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over ten minutes have gone by so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.66,0:10:13.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Kirigaya and Asuna's Fluctlights will
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.28,0:10:15.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,reach the limit of their\Nmemory capacity soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.60,0:10:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.22,0:10:20.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like the hijackers are retreating.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.50,0:10:22.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They... they are?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.30,0:10:26.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're heading down to the\NOcean Turtle submarine dock.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.78,0:10:28.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they're in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.74,0:10:31.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.78,0:10:33.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did something hit us? Checking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.12,0:10:36.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.68,0:10:37.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.59,0:10:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kojiro, that jolt was caused by\Nour engine firing up to full power!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.88,0:10:42.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meaning?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.00,0:10:44.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We may have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.54,0:10:51.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The main engine at the bottom of the\Nshaft is a pressurized water reactor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.76,0:10:58.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.14,0:10:59.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.10,0:11:04.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They planted C4 on that tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.78,0:11:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The CRD's under it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.66,0:11:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if that's destroyed,\Nthe control rods can't drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.72,0:11:16.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The core will melt down. What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.74,0:11:25.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go down there and disarm the bomb.\NI'm sure the hijackers gave themselves
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.14,0:11:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,enough time to get far enough away\Nbefore it blows that gives me about
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.62,0:11:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know five to ten minutes but\Nthe temperature down there by now it's
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.24,0:11:40.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got to be boiling, true, but it's\Nnot hotter than your typical sauna.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.80,0:11:44.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll rush in, yink the detonator,\Nand be out in a few seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.22,0:11:46.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.64,0:11:47.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nakanishi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.48,0:12:12.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keeks, he's screwed with the reactor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.60,0:12:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounded like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.10,0:12:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.50,0:12:17.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just keep working.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.60,0:12:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut those STLs down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.56,0:12:20.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.02,0:12:25.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say, Higa.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.90,0:12:28.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't need me right now, do you? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.34,0:12:30.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.32,0:12:31.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not going down there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.08,0:12:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.34,0:12:35.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just want to scope out\Nthe situation, is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.94,0:12:37.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It shouldn't take long.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.86,0:12:39.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A few minutes, Tops.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.72,0:12:42.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, see you in a bit. Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.20,0:12:44.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch your back down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.20,0:12:58.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap. Geeks.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:00.00,0:13:03.55,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs62\alpha&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\fnQuadraat-Bold\blur0.5\pos(559.894,730.343)\alpha&HFF&\t(0,120,\alpha&H20&)}T{\alpha&HFF&\t(18,138,\alpha&H20&)}u{\alpha&HFF&\t(36,156,\alpha&H20&)}e{\alpha&HFF&\t(54,174,\alpha&H20&)}s{\alpha&HFF&\t(72,192,\alpha&H20&)}d{\alpha&HFF&\t(90,210,\alpha&H20&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(108,228,\alpha&H20&)}y{\alpha&HFF&\t(126,246,\alpha&H20&)}, {\alpha&HFF&\t(144,264,\alpha&H20&)}J{\alpha&HFF&\t(162,282,\alpha&H20&)}u{\alpha&HFF&\t(180,300,\alpha&H20&)}l{\alpha&HFF&\t(198,318,\alpha&H20&)}y {\alpha&HFF&\t(216,336,\alpha&H20&)}7{\alpha&HFF&\t(234,354,\alpha&H20&)}, {\alpha&HFF&\t(252,372,\alpha&H20&)}2{\alpha&HFF&\t(270,390,\alpha&H20&)}0{\alpha&HFF&\t(288,408,\alpha&H20&)}2{\alpha&HFF&\t(306,426,\alpha&H20&)}6{\alpha&HFF&\t(324,444,\alpha&H20&)}, {\alpha&HFF&\t(342,462,\alpha&H20&)}1{\alpha&HFF&\t(360,480,\alpha&H20&)}0{\alpha&HFF&\t(378,498,\alpha&H20&)}:{\alpha&HFF&\t(396,516,\alpha&H20&)}1{\alpha&HFF&\t(414,534,\alpha&H20&)}2 {\alpha&HFF&\t(432,552,\alpha&H20&)}A{\alpha&HFF&\t(450,570,\alpha&H20&)}M
Dialogue: 1,0:13:00.21,0:13:03.55,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs62\alpha&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\fnQuadraat-Bold\blur0.5\pos(750.858,822.857)\alpha&HFF&\t(0,120,\alpha&H20&)}O{\alpha&HFF&\t(17,137,\alpha&H20&)}c{\alpha&HFF&\t(34,154,\alpha&H20&)}e{\alpha&HFF&\t(52,172,\alpha&H20&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(69,189,\alpha&H20&)}n {\alpha&HFF&\t(86,206,\alpha&H20&)}T{\alpha&HFF&\t(104,224,\alpha&H20&)}u{\alpha&HFF&\t(121,241,\alpha&H20&)}r{\alpha&HFF&\t(138,258,\alpha&H20&)}t{\alpha&HFF&\t(156,276,\alpha&H20&)}l{\alpha&HFF&\t(173,293,\alpha&H20&)}e{\alpha&HFF&\t(191,311,\alpha&H20&)}, {\alpha&HFF&\t(208,328,\alpha&H20&)}R{\alpha&HFF&\t(225,345,\alpha&H20&)}e{\alpha&HFF&\t(243,363,\alpha&H20&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(260,380,\alpha&H20&)}c{\alpha&HFF&\t(277,397,\alpha&H20&)}t{\alpha&HFF&\t(295,415,\alpha&H20&)}o{\alpha&HFF&\t(312,432,\alpha&H20&)}r {\alpha&HFF&\t(330,450,\alpha&H20&)}E{\alpha&HFF&\t(347,467,\alpha&H20&)}m{\alpha&HFF&\t(364,484,\alpha&H20&)}e{\alpha&HFF&\t(382,502,\alpha&H20&)}r{\alpha&HFF&\t(399,519,\alpha&H20&)}g{\alpha&HFF&\t(416,536,\alpha&H20&)}e{\alpha&HFF&\t(434,554,\alpha&H20&)}n{\alpha&HFF&\t(451,571,\alpha&H20&)}c{\alpha&HFF&\t(468,588,\alpha&H20&)}y {\alpha&HFF&\t(486,606,\alpha&H20&)}C{\alpha&HFF&\t(503,623,\alpha&H20&)}o{\alpha&HFF&\t(521,641,\alpha&H20&)}n{\alpha&HFF&\t(538,658,\alpha&H20&)}t{\alpha&HFF&\t(555,675,\alpha&H20&)}r{\alpha&HFF&\t(573,693,\alpha&H20&)}o{\alpha&HFF&\t(590,710,\alpha&H20&)}l {\alpha&HFF&\t(607,727,\alpha&H20&)}R{\alpha&HFF&\t(625,745,\alpha&H20&)}o{\alpha&HFF&\t(642,762,\alpha&H20&)}o{\alpha&HFF&\t(660,780,\alpha&H20&)}m
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.94,0:13:28.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They either left him behind to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.42,0:13:30.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or he's nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.70,0:13:35.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.92,0:13:40.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Niemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.16,0:13:42.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what's piloting it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.64,0:13:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, Rank!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.42,0:13:49.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Akihiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.33,0:13:50.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.74,0:13:59.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I left you on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.98,0:14:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The way I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.20,0:14:02.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.98,0:14:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.54,0:14:09.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rank, I was blessed to\Nhave you in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.74,0:14:11.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was so lost in my work,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.68,0:14:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you were the only thing keeping\Nme connected to the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.26,0:14:19.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, I'd like you to\Nmaintain that connection.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.60,0:14:23.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bridge the gap between the\Nreal and virtual worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.66,0:14:26.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fulfill my dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.28,0:14:28.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.84,0:14:31.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.54,0:14:47.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's getting shot to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.42,0:14:48.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I better move.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.88,0:14:56.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you hit?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.48,0:15:02.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Akihiko.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.70,0:15:18.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, the battery cable's damaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.78,0:15:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time\Nbefore it stops functioning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.68,0:15:24.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.72,0:15:36.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.80,0:15:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Akihiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.02,0:15:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He had lost power.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.46,0:15:56.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.56,0:16:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Akihiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.78,0:16:05.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your Heathcliff of the\NDivine Blade, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.80,0:16:10.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The greatest rival to the Black\NSwordsman ever had, and he never gave up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.82,0:16:14.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that kid could do the\Nimpossible, then so can you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.00,0:16:33.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it. It's moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.18,0:17:18.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.20,0:17:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like they disarmed the bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.16,0:17:49.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe Hans decided to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.26,0:17:54.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, him and Brig were\Nalways tight, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.16,0:17:56.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's that, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.04,0:18:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only two?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.82,0:18:02.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, Shack! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.26,0:18:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you guys to\Ngrab and bag all the bodies?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.42,0:18:09.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's only two of them here. Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.72,0:18:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was only Brig and Captain Miller.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.64,0:18:13.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We did a sweep and they were it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.60,0:18:18.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But wasn't there one more in the STL room?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.94,0:18:21.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, man. Just the captain. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.68,0:18:24.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His face freaked the hell out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.34,0:18:38.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rank, log out for Kirito\Nand Asuna is almost done.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.04,0:18:40.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One minute to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.22,0:18:42.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.13,0:18:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.05,0:18:44.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll send someone down to get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.72,0:18:45.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.63,0:18:49.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the shape I'm in, I doubt I'd\Nmake it one rung up this ladder.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.94,0:18:53.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heeks went down to check on whatever\Nwas going on with the engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.34,0:18:55.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was bleeding pretty bad when he left.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.16,0:18:57.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know if he's okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.16,0:18:59.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, he's better than okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.02,0:19:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He ran in there guns a-blazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.08,0:19:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like the hero in an action movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.98,0:19:06.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I saw that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.56,0:19:08.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.74,0:19:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thirty seconds left to log out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.90,0:19:13.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll head over to Kirigaya's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.52,0:19:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got my comms on if you need anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.82,0:19:16.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.76,0:19:19.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dr. Kochiro, come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.10,0:19:25.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're uh in the engine room yes i'm\Nhere is something wrong well we removed
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.66,0:19:28.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the explosive from the tank but um
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.56,0:19:33.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Niemon he's um gone
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.80,0:19:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what where'd he go
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.74,0:19:44.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys! Come back to\Nus, please. Be okay, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.44,0:20:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for watching.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:06.43,0:21:10.62,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,500)}They're connected
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.98,0:21:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.72,0:21:33.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.34,0:21:39.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew if I left you alone,\Nyou'd turn into a crybaby.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.42,0:21:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you pretty well,\Nif I do say so myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.38,0:22:16.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we get back home, I bet\NAlice will be so angry with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.78,0:22:20.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe not, as long as\Nwe still remember her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.58,0:22:23.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the time we spent with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.86,0:22:25.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we don't forget that, we're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.84,0:22:27.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.26,0:22:29.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't forget Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.60,0:22:31.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or Liz.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.00,0:22:32.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or Klein.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.30,0:22:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or Akihiko and Silica.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.28,0:22:37.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or our little Yui.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.32,0:22:41.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as we remember\Nthem, we'll be alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.52,0:22:42.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Won't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.06,0:22:51.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, how long will we be living here again?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.00,0:22:56.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About 200 years give or take.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.10,0:22:58.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could do a thousand years!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.48,0:23:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easy if I'm with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.74,0:23:04.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All righty then, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.32,0:23:08.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.14,0:23:13.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a new world now,\Nand we've got lots to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.74,0:23:15.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see if we can help it out.
